This repo is `"type": "module"`, so Node will treat `scripts/build-binaries.js` as ESM. The script currently uses CommonJS `require(...)`, which will fail under ESM (`ReferenceError: require is not defined`) when invoked via `node scripts/build-binaries.js`. Convert this file to ESM `import` syntax, or rename it to `build-binaries.cjs` and update `package.json` scripts accordingly.
```suggestion
import fs from 'fs';
import path from 'path';
import { execSync } from 'child_process';
import { fileURLToPath } from 'url';

const __filename = fileURLToPath(import.meta.url);
const __dirname = path.dirname(__filename);
